<div class="sg-theme-showroom">
	<div class="page-template-page-locations">
		{% include "@sections/01-header/_showroom-header.twig" %}
		<main>
			<section class="hero-container">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="hero--image">
							<iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m16!1m12!1m3!1d1764722.060072631!2d-90.26900856481848!3d30.235444792463777!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!2m1!1scoburn&#39;s!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1585070322879!5m2!1sen!2sus" width="712" height="468" frameborder="0" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" aria-hidden="false" tabindex="0"></iframe>
						</div>
						<div class="hero--text">
							<div class="content-flow-headings">
								<h1 class="heading-style-minimal">Showroom Locations</h1>
								<h2 class="h1 display">Find A Showroom <nobr>Near You.</nobr></h2>
							</div>
							<div class="hero--locations">
								<div class="hero--locations-buttons">
									<form class="hero--form form-search">
										<label class="sr-only">Search</label>
										<div class="input-group">
											<input class="form-control" placeholder="Enter Zip Code or Search Term…">
											<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">{% include "@icons/search.twig" %}<span class="form-search-text">Search</span>
											</button>
										</div>
									</form>
									<a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-shadow" href="#">{% include "@icons/location.twig" %}<span>Find Locations Near Me</span></a>
								</div>
								<div class="hero--locations-text content-flow">
									<p>With Coburn's Showrooms throughout Texas, Louisiana, Mississippi, Alabama and Tennessee, design inspiration and an experienced team are always nearby.</p>
									<p>Click one of our kitchen, bath and home improvement showrooms locations below for hours of operation, contact information and a who’s who of our dynamic team members.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section>
				<div class="container">{% include "@sections/07-locations/_01-listing.twig" %}</div>
				<div class="container">
					<div class="justify-content-md-center row">
						<div class="locations--page-content">
							<div class="content-flow">
								<p>When you walk into a Coburn's Showroom, you can expect to be greeted warmly by our team, and wowed by our incredible range of hand-selected products perfect for turning your dream into a reality. Our friendly, knowledgeable Showroom Consultants are here to assist you through your new build, remodel or new design plans.</p>
							</div>
							<a class="btn btn-blue-dark btn-shadow" href="#">{% include "@icons/coburns.twig" %}<span>See all Coburn's Locations</span></a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<div class="ankle-container">{% include "@sections/03-ankle.twig"%}</div>
		{% include "@sections/04-footer/_footer.twig" %}
	</div>
</div>
